    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market this fabulous large detached residence located in the very popular area of Stonepark Abbey in Rathfarnham.\r\nGiven the build quality, exceptional location, and large size of the property, it is likely to appeal to a wide variety of buyers.\r\nThe property is entered by the large open hallway which is bright and airy, leading into the fully integrated kitchen to the rear, and large sitting room to the right.\r\nThe bespoke kitchen is finished to a high standard with high and low level contemporary cabinets with integrated appliances, and plenty of space for cooking and entertaining. The space has been extended to the rear, with multiple large skylights giving exceptional lighting. The extension opens into a very large dining area, with double doors leading to the sitting room. Tasteful additions such as recessed lighting and floor to ceiling radiators add to the finish and create a bright and modern space.\r\nThe sitting room is also large in size with an abundance of natural light, including bay window and feature fireplace. The double doors flow into the separate dining room and continues into the rear extension, making the space dual aspect and covering the length of the property.\r\nThere is also downstairs w/c off the hall, fully tiled and modernised, an essential in contemporary living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs the large open landing gives way to four bedrooms. There are two doubles and two large singles. All rooms come with built in wardrobes and the master being en-suite. Another bay window in the master bedroom gives plenty of natural lighting,\r\nThis home is in excellent condition throughout and at over 158 Metres Sq., offers considerable living space.\r\nSet on a quiet cul-de-sac with excellent neighbours, detached properties in Stonepark Abbey do not come to market often, so it is sure to prove popular.\r\nThe location is second to none, being located close to schools and créches. There are also a number of amenities nearby, with Rathfarnham village just minutes away. The M50 motorway is also close by, with a number of bus routes also on the doorstep.\r\nThis property really needs to be viewed to be appreciated, and offers a large, spacious property with excellent use of light and in an enviable location.\r\nFor a viewing, please apply online, leave your name, number and email address and we will get right back to you. If you have any questions or wish to discuss the property further, please call Jason on 01-4926004."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Fantastic Property in a Great location\r\n\r\nOff Street Parking Included\r\n\r\nExtended to the Rear\r\n\r\nClose to every Amenity you could ask for\r\n\r\nAbundance of Natural Light\r\n\r\nLarge Detached Property - 158Msq.\r\n\r\nSet on Quiet Cul-de-sac\r\n\r\nFreshly Painted throughout"
      },
